<title>SWEDEN: Skanska says wins U.S. orders.</title>
<headline>Skanska says wins U.S. orders.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction group Skanska said on Wednesday it had booked orders totalling $450 million in recent weeks for its North Amercian operations.</p>
</text>
